<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Give up the world, Christ to obtain,</l><l>He is the One you require;</l><l>Once you receive this glorious Christ,</l><l>Never the rest you’ll desire.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Though very great is all the world,</l><l>And very small is your heart,</l><l>Yet the great world with all its wealth</l><l>Never can fill your small heart.</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>If you have Christ, you have all joys;</l><l>Without this Christ, only pains;</l><l>Where there is Christ there morning is;</l><l>Where He is not, night remains.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
